ocument map table, and a laptop showing the package's Excel self-assessment (a long list of assessment rows with colored status cells and a bar chart per chapter). Do not redesign, simplify, recolor, or rebrand the box. SET & PROPS: Inpatient ward nurse station in the evening: a long counter with two thick plain binders, a computer monitor, a wall-mounted hand sanitizer, a corridor with patient room doors behind, nurses only as blurred passing shapes, cool ceiling light with warm light from a side room. TIMELINE — 10 seconds: 0–2s Hook · close-up: two binders opened side by side showing similar pages with different stamps (no readable text); cut to medium shot as he looks up to the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Di ruangan ini ada dua SPO." Delivery (EN): calm, serious 2–4s Problem · medium shot, he lifts one binder in each hand. VO (ID, verbatim): "Judulnya sama, tanggalnya beda." Delivery (EN): honest 4–6s Problem · medium close-up, he glances down the corridor, then back. VO (ID, verbatim): "Perawat pakai yang mana?" Delivery (EN): concerned 6–8s Problem · medium shot, he sets both binders down on the counter. VO (ID, verbatim): "Surveior pasti menanyakan ini." Delivery (EN): quiet, firm 8–10s Beat · medium shot, he pushes his glasses up and exhales. VO: none. AUDIO: Quiet ward ambience at night, a distant call bell, soft footsteps. Only the talent speaks. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: follow the camera style above consistently; stable and restrained, no whip pans, no drone, no 360 orbit. Keep product readable whenever it is on screen. Performance: natural facial expression, believable professional UGC, natural eye contact, restrained gestures, no exaggerated acting. Lips clearly synced to each word. Hands: simple, natural, relaxed movements. CLEAN OUTPUT: No subtitles, captions, 